**Inherent Risk Scoring Model**

(5 × 5 likelihood/impact methodology)


**Likelihood:**

| Score | Definition     |
| ----: | -------------- |
|     1 | Rare           |
|     2 | Unlikely       |
|     3 | Possible       |
|     4 | Likely         |
|     5 | Almost Certain |


**Impact:**

| Score | Definition    |
| ----: | ------------- |
|     1 | Insignificant |
|     2 | Minor         |
|     3 | Moderate      |
|     4 | Major         |
|     5 | Severe        |


**Formula:**
Risk Score = Likelihood × Impact

| Score | Rating   |
| ----: | -------- |
|   1–5 | Low      |
|  6–11 | Medium   |
| 12–19 | High     |
| 20–25 | Critical |


